  "body": "Adds `site/content/guide/troubleshooting.md`, organised by the message the user sees (message, meaning, causes, fix), linked from `guide/refusals.md` and the guide index.\n\nFork synced at v0.18.0 (cut from upstream/main 37482923).\n\nEntries and the source of each message:\n- `no GPU adapter could render to this window` - ui/src/egui_app/gpu_select.rs; `unknown GPU backend ...`, `--gpu-backend needs a value` - gpu.rs\n- `no operations to post` (+ every operation is suppressed), `no toolpath yet`, `inputs moved since generation`, `fix the tool before posting`, `cannot write` - app/src/posting.rs\n- `<op>'s tool '<tool>' is gone;` - app/src/operation/tool_gate.rs; `tool <n> is not in the library` - app/src/machine/mod.rs\n- `post blocked - ... warning(s)`, `no post resolved for its setup` - posting_per_op.rs\n- `gouge: program cuts below the model`, `stock sim did not judge this program`, `carries no generator-time verify verdict` - posting_sim.rs\n- verify warnings (shank/holder collides, holder rubs, rapid below clearance, strikes a fixture) - sim/src/verify/types.rs\n- `machine <name>: <n> limit problem(s)`, rpm and stroke lines - posting_mounts.rs, app/src/machine/mod.rs\n- `no stock yet - set it up in Setup > Stock` - ui/src/operations.rs; vise `reaches ... into the fixed jaw` - app/src/vise.rs\n- lathe orientation - posting_nose.rs; `holder not set` - ui/src/state_tool_profile.rs, tools/src/holder_library.rs\n\nNot covered (left for later): model imports at the wrong scale (no import-scale setting found to name), turning/EDM/plasma refusals, the issue's 20-entry target (this has about 24 headings but some are grouped), and the suggested test that checks each message stem still exists in source. `zola` is not installed here, so `zola check` was not run; links use `@/guide/...` paths like sibling pages.\n\nChangelog: none\nEffort: medium\n\nFixes #1244\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
